      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chashikili kakweji kamuchitanu nachiyedi, hadiŋuwu anyana kaIsarela munyikala, antu hiyakupompa kuYerusalema namuchima wawu wumu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaYozadaki Yeshuwa, nawana kwindi atupristu, ni mwana kaSheyaleteli Zerubabeli, nawana kwindi, hiyakunyamuka, hiyakutuŋa kameŋa kaNzambi yaIsarela, kulonda kulambwilahu nyilambu yakushita, mwasonekeluwu munshimbi jamuntu waNzambi Mosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakusha kameŋa hetentaminu daku, muloŋa anatiyi dehi woma wawantu amumatuŋowu. Hiyakumulambwilahu Yehova nyilambu yakushita, yoyi nyilambu yakushita yabudidi namelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakudya chawija chayisolu mwachisonekelawu, hiyakulambulaŋa nyilambu yakushita yakuchinda yahefuku hefuku, mwomuchaya, ifuku namudimu wadu, ifuku namudimu wadu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "himu kulondela himulambu wakushitawa hefukuhefuku, ninyilambu yatukweji twatwiha, ninyilambu yayawija yaYehova yakushiika yajilikiluwu yejima, niyawantu ejima amulambwili Yehova nyilambu yakumuchima, alambwilaŋa chamu nyichima yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atachikili kuhimulambu la Yehova nyilambu yakushita kufumisha kwifuku dakusambila dakakweji kamuchitanu nachiyedi; achidi kanda ali chikuku chakutuŋila tembeli yaYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakwinka niakwakusoŋa malola, niakwakusoŋa nyitondu, mali; hiyakwinka akwaZidoni niakwaTira yakudya nayakunwa nimanji, kulonda aletaŋa kukaluŋalwiji kuYopa nyisida yakuLebanoni, mwayiitejeleliyi mwanta wakuPeresi Kirusi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
