          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wamuchiyedi wakufumisha henjiluwu kwitala daNzambi kuYerusalema, mukakweji kamu chiyedi, mwana kaSheyaleteli Zerubabeli, ni mwana kaYozadaki Yeshuwa, niana kwawu asheluku atupristu nawaLevi, niantu ejima, afumini muwuduŋu enjili kuYerusalema, hiyakutachika; hiyakukunjika aLevi kumudimu wakutala mudimu wakwitala daYehova, kufumisha kudi anyaka makumi ayedi niakubadikamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeshuwa nawanyanindi nawana kwindi, naKadimiyeli nawanyanindi, anyana kaYuda, hiyakwimana hamu nakutala akwakukoŋa nyidimu mwitala daNzambi; nianyana kaHenadadi, hamu nawanyanawu amayala nawana kwawu aLevi nawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheliluwu akwakutuŋa hiyakwala chikuku chakutuŋila tembeli yaYehova, hiyakwimikaku atupristu nampùŋa jawu, anavwali wuvwalu wawu, niaLevi anyana kaAsafwi namachakayi awu, kulonda amuhamekaŋa Yehova mwaloŋeshayi dehi mwanta wawaIsarela Davidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakwimba, awa nakutumbula, awa nakwakwijia, hiyakuhameka nakusakilila Yehova, nawu, Himuwahi, luwi lwindi lwatiyilaŋayi aIsarela lwahaya nyaka. Chamuhamekeluwu Yehova, antu ejima hiyakudikuwa, kudikuwa kwasweja, nanochu chaaliluwu chikuku chetala daYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atupristu nawaLevi amavulu, nawawakulumpi akumavumu awankakulula, wowu amapala amweni itala dakusambila, chamwenuwu hiyakwala chikuku chetalidi, hiyakudila ikumbu dadeni, iku akwawu amavulu adi nakudikuwa nakuzaŋalala; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "antukutwesha kushinshika niipumba dakudikuwa nakuzaŋalala, niipumbadakudilawu antu nehi, muloŋa antu adikuwili naŋovu yayeni, niipumbadatiyakeni kwakulehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
